 **Parameters:**
-*   **Smoothing Strength:** Controls the trade-off between noise reduction and resolution loss [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Curvature Metric:** Choice between Mean, Gaussian, or principal curvatures ($k_1, k_2$) [S4, unofficial].
